{"read_id": "READ-20261028-6bcbbf", "session_id": "SESSION-20261028-5aa1b4", "target": {"type": "question", "id": "Q-062"}, "reading": "interpreted", "note": "書くことの労働性を問う糸を、共同労働と同調の場面で展開した。", "created_at": "2026-10-28"}
